The fixture imports Flow /authoring, not the optional layout API. The pinned
Flow layout API itself explicitly loads elkjs/lib/elk.bundled.js. The Svelte
dependency crawl eagerly optimized elkjs's unused Node main entry. The bounded
fixture repair excludes elkjs from eager dependency optimization; it introduces
no source alias and does not change installed packages or source candidate.

A second start repeated this same error because an incorrect relative copy
path left the old consumer config in place. Correcting the copy to an absolute
fixture path applied the intended optimizer exclusion. No package source was
changed and no retry was reported as a successful browser observation.
